# Board Attestation on Internal Control

Signed statement by the board that the internal control system is operated as described in the policy set. It references the audit plan for the year.

## Scope reference — CONT-04: Internal audit programme executed
Requirement addressed: An internal audit programme covers the framework scope every year and records findings and their owners.

- Audit plan: Recorded in EV-008 (Board Attestation on Internal Control).
- Scope covered: Recorded in EV-008 (Board Attestation on Internal Control).
- Findings: Recorded in EV-008 (Board Attestation on Internal Control).
- Auditor name: Recorded in EV-008 (Board Attestation on Internal Control).

Signed: Board Chair (2026-03-05)
